  {
   "framerName": "Process V2",
   "items": [
    {
     "t": "code",
     "text": "WHY TECHNICAL OUTBOUND STALLS"
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "text": "Engineers ignore the outreach everyone else sends"
    },
    {
     "t": "h2",
     "text": "CTOs and VPs of Engineering get pitched daily by dev shops that all sound identical. Generic “we build scalable software” outreach gets deleted. To sound credible, you need real research per prospect - and that means pulling your best people off billable work, or duct-taping a $753/mo tool stack that still misses."
    },
    {
     "img": "/assets/pages/landing/img/cSfuUaRCe6mtjQgGygGXc0Ms.png",
     "box": "1344x56"
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "text": "Generic pitches die with buyers"
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "text": "\"We're an offshore dev partner\" reads like every other message in their inbox. Engineers reply to specifics - your stack, their problem - not slogans. Templates can't do that."
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "text": "DELETED ON SIGHT BY CTOS"
    },
    {
     "img": "/assets/pages/landing/img/0WWjyvAaj9FemoWYIj02vT4iyDM.png",
     "box": "448x274"
    },
    {
     "img": "/assets/pages/landing/img/wbD2M1e4heMO5vhFyOVSd06raU.png",
     "box": "327x238"
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "text": "Sales pulls people off delivery"
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "text": "Your senior engineers are billable. Every hour they spend prospecting or qualifying is an hour not shipping - and the one BD hire can't research fast enough to keep the pipeline full."
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "text": "BILLABLE HOURS LOST TO PROSPECTING"
    },
    {
     "img": "/assets/pages/landing/img/pcdOvBzgiyoCEwCOpF4fCU2wFE.png",
     "box": "448x274"
    },
    {
     "img": "/assets/pages/landing/img/A7eybC2DWbIXqCqH5pElLOD4s.png",
     "box": "327x238"
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "text": "The research doesn't scale"
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "text": "To sound credible to a CTO you need 30 minutes of research per prospect. Do that by hand and you reach ten people a week. Skip it and your reply rate dies an no sign of next client."
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "text": "CREDIBILITY DOESN'T SCALE BY HAND"
    },
    {
     "img": "/assets/pages/landing/img/d2ZWq2gqUINlAfjT4c6EGNOvcE.png",
     "box": "448x274"
    },
    {
     "img": "/assets/pages/landing/img/KXmPUH6iN7kM8tUEwzTIvGKjKw.png",
     "box": "327x238"
    }
   ]
  },
